# `electron` is a devDependency for its type declarations only (the plugin
# runs inside Obsidian's own Electron). Set ELECTRON_SKIP_BINARY_DOWNLOAD=1
# in the environment before `npm install` to skip the 100 MB binary its
# install script fetches; the release workflow does. npm 11 accepts no
# per-project spelling of that switch, so nothing is set here.
